      "id": "claim_8af09f1039564a71b7c68480cddb9614",
      "statement": "Program.cs wires options configuration with ValidateOnStart() and registers the generated ValidateSebastianConfig singleton, so data-annotation failures surface during host startup while run-time coherence rules (empty list, duplicate names, unknown selection, malformed endpoint on the selected entry) can only come from ProviderResolver's constructor; both producers terminate startup.",
